      "target": "A **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit of yours, wholly within the [Flow of Magic](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.hexwarp-thrallband.flow-of-magic) of your army, that is yet to be **selected to shoot** in this phase.",
